<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('../partials/head', {
    pageTitle: 'Cookie Policy',
    pageDescription: 'How ' + settings.site_name + ' uses cookies and similar technologies on this website.',
    canonicalUrl: siteUrl + '/cookie-policy'
  }) %>
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('../partials/header') %>

  <section id="main">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:760px;">
      <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
      <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
      <div class="trace"></div>
      <p class="muted" style="margin-bottom:32px;">Last updated: <%= new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' }) %></p>

      <div class="post-body">

        <p>This Cookie Policy explains how <strong><%= settings.site_name %></strong> (the "Site," "we," "us," or "our") uses cookies and similar technologies when you visit our website. This Policy should be read together with our <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

        <h2>1. What Are Cookies</h2>
        <p>Cookies are small text files placed on your device by a website you visit. They are widely used to make websites function properly, to improve user experience, and to provide information to the operators of the site.</p>

        <h2>2. Cookies We Use</h2>

        <h3>2.1 Strictly Necessary Cookies</h3>
        <p>We use a session cookie to maintain administrator login sessions on this Site. This cookie is essential for the administrative dashboard to function and does not track visitors for advertising or analytics purposes. It is not set for ordinary visitors browsing the public pages of the Site.</p>

        <h3>2.2 Advertising Cookies</h3>
        <p>If advertising is enabled on this Site, third-party advertising cookies may be set by Google AdSense and its advertising partners. These cookies may be used to serve advertisements based on your visits to this and other websites. We do not control these cookies directly; they are governed by Google's own policies. You can learn more and manage your preferences at <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Ads Settings</a> and review Google's practices at <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/cookies" target="_blank" rel="noopener">How Google uses cookies</a>.</p>

        <h3>2.3 No Analytics or Tracking Cookies (Unless Stated Otherwise)</h3>
        <p>Except as described above, this Site does not currently use analytics, tracking, or profiling cookies of its own. If this changes, this Policy will be updated accordingly.</p>

        <h2>3. Managing Cookies</h2>
        <p>Most web browsers allow you to control cookies through their settings, including blocking or deleting cookies. Please note that disabling strictly necessary cookies may affect the functionality of certain features of the Site, such as the administrative dashboard. Instructions for managing cookies are typically available in your browser's "Settings" or "Preferences" menu.</p>

        <h2>4. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>We may update this Cookie Policy from time to time to reflect changes in the cookies we use or for legal or regulatory reasons. The "Last updated" date at the top of this page indicates when this Policy was last revised.</p>

        <h2>5. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>If you have questions about this Cookie Policy, please contact us at:</p>
        <p>
          <strong><%= settings.site_name %></strong><br>
          Email: <a href="mailto:<%= settings.contact_email %>"><%= settings.contact_email %></a><br>
          Location: <%= settings.contact_location %>
        </p>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <%- include('../partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
